  "details": "I made a new group for a VRChat event tomorrow.  I sent the link to a few people.  I invited a few others manually.\n\nWhen all of them have been accepted and they are in the member list, I can't search for the ones that REQUESTED to edit their roles or remove them from the group.  I CAN invite people and THEN add their roles and remove them from the group.\n\nItsBigHB was invited by me to the group and I can add roles to him and search for him.  BestGalaxy requested and I can't find him in the group outside of this page in the image.  I told one person to leave and then sent them an invite, and now i can assign roles to them.",
